		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " At an allow-conditional position, `infer U extends number ?` starts a",
			"start": 20,
			"end": 92
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " conditional: the `extends number` re-binds as the conditional's extends",
			"start": 94,
			"end": 168
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " clause and the check is the bare `infer U` (the TS constraint rollback rule)",
			"start": 170,
			"end": 249
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " Same re-binding at the top level of the alias value",
			"start": 321,
			"end": 375
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " Inside a tuple member",
			"start": 430,
			"end": 454
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " Inside an object-type member",
			"start": 526,
			"end": 557
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " Inside a type argument",
			"start": 627,
			"end": 652
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " The check can be a union ending in a constrained infer (`A | infer U`)",
			"start": 731,
			"end": 804
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " A function-type return is an allow position: the conditional is the return type",
